# Student Tracker Midterm

## Description
This program basically allows users to manage student records including GPA and attendance.

## Features
- Add students
- View all students
- Search students by name
- Calculate class GPA average
- Display honor roll students (GPA >= 3.5)

## This code you should just copy and paste it if you're lazy, haha.

Compile:
g++ main.cpp -o midterm

Run:
./midterm